==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{m|ru|про́ба}}, from {{der|ru|pl|próba}} or {{der|ru|de|Probe}}, from Middle Latin {{m|la|proba}}, from {{m|la|probō}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro||*pro-bʰH-wó-s|t=being in front}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*pro-|t=forward}} + {{m|ine-pro|*bʰuH-|t=to be}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|про́бовать}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-пробовать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|про́бовать|impf|pf=попро́бовать|vn=про́бование<q:nomen acitonis>,про́бовальщик<q:nomen agentis, occasional>}}

# to [[test]], to [[attempt]], to [[try]]
# to [[taste]] (to sample the flavor of something), to [[feel]]

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf|2a+p|про́бовать}}
{{ru-conj-old|impf|2a+p|про́бовать}}

